{
 "id": "5d959716-4c46-4b45-9a0e-4e97ff4a885c",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Maou to Issho no Kakokuna Isekai Seikatsu ~Ei Homura no Tabiji~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "A Harsh Life in Another World with the Demon King: The Eternal Flame’s Journey"
   },
   {
    "ja": "魔王と一緒の過酷な異世界生活～永焔の旅路～【タテヨミ】"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lexi Adelmann, a second-year student at Arcana Academy, is a fire magic prodigy— wild, energetic, and so powerful even her teachers struggle to keep up.\n\nBut when a mysterious top student named Ignart transfers in, Lexi is assigned to partner with him on a dangerous mission: Track down a group of elite adventurers who went missing during a top-secret operation.\n\nThese missing elites would later become known as the “10 Heroes of Morta.”\n\nFor Lexi, it’s her first time meeting someone with power equal to her own, and the thrill is undeniable. For Ignart, it’s his first time dealing with someone this unpredictable.\n\nCan this chaotic duo overcome their clashing personalities to complete their mission—and possibly change the fate of the world?\n\nThis is the untold story of Lexi and Ignart’s student days— a fiery and fateful journey before they became legends.",
   "ja": "炎系統の魔法に優れたアルカナアカデミー2年生、レクシィ・アデルマン。\n\n魔法使いとしての実力は圧倒的で、教師陣でさえ手がつけられない世間知らずで活発な彼女は、ある日アカデミーに編入してきた優等生イグナートとタッグを組むことが決まる。2人に与えられた任務は、特殊任務に出て行方不明になった精鋭（後のモルタの10英雄）の捜索だった。生まれて初めて同等の力を持つ人間と出会い興奮するレクシィと、彼女の突発的な行動に戸惑うイグナート。\n\n相反する性格の2人は無事に任務を終え、世界に平和をもたらすことができるのだろうか？ゲーム本編でモルタの10英雄として語られているレクシィとイグナート、2人の学生時代を描いたスピンオフ！"
  },
